<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Misawa - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Misawa - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.93		vs	   11.28</p>
<p> Operating	   19 million	 vs	    9 million</p>
<p> Current	     56 million	 vs	   19 million</p>
<p> Net		   23 million	 vs	   10 million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.03 yen	  vs	    0.94 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyo Misawa Homes Co Ltd is a subcontractor involved in the installation of prefabricated houses for Misawa Homes.</p>
